/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
51.0236220472441033 505.9844881889763428 Td
(NEHvigation solves this by providing a unified Singapore Toll & Energy Optimizer. It evaluates live and scheduled LTA) Tj
T* (ERP gantry rates, calculates vehicle-specific fuel/EV consumption with urban traffic idling adjustments, calculates total) Tj
T* (monetary cost per route option, and automatically identifies the most cost-effective path.) Tj
